><p class="card_text">Optional: keep your ERP as source of truth, or include ERP where it fits. Prices, stock and orders sync - no retyping.</p></div><div class="feature-tile"><img src="/images/home/home2-channels-hub.jpg" loading="lazy" sizes="100vw" srcset="/images/home/home2-channels-hub-p-500.jpg 500w, /images/home/home2-channels-hub-p-800.jpg 800w, /images/home/home2-channels-hub-p-1080.jpg 1080w, /images/home/home2-channels-hub.jpg 1280w" alt="Sell on marketplaces from one channels hub" class="image-card"/><h3 class="heading-h3">Channels hub</h3><p class="card_text">Sell on marketplaces and comparison sites from one hub - stock and orders stay in step.</p></div><div class="feature-tile"><img src="/images/home/home2-portal-sales-orderhub.jpg" loading="lazy" sizes="(max-width: 1280px) 100vw, 1280px" srcset="/images/home/home2-portal-sales-orderhub-p-500.jpg 500w, /images/home/home2-portal-sales-orderhub-p-800.jpg 800w, /images/home/home2-portal-sales-orderhub-p-1080.jpg 1080w, /images/home/home2-portal-sales-orderhub.jpg 1280w" alt="Portal, Sales App and OrderHub for buyers and field sales" class="image-card"/><h3 class="heading-h3">Portal · Sales App · OrderHub</h3><p class="card_text">Customer portals with each account&#x27;s own prices, field sales with live stock, and AI that turns emailed orders into ERP orders.</p></div><div class="feature-tile"><img src="/images/home/home2-search-typo-tolerant.jpg" loading="lazy" sizes="100vw" srcset="/images/home/home2-search-typo-tolerant-p-500.jpg 500w, /images/home/home2-search-typo-tolerant-p-800.jpg 800w, /images/home/home2-search-typo-tolerant-p-1080.jpg 1080w, /images/home/home2-search-typo-tolerant.jpg 1280w" alt="Built-in typo-tolerant search" class="image-card"/><h3 class="heading-h3">Search that forgives typos</h3><p class="card_text">Built-in, typo-tolerant search - find means sold, with no add-on tool.</p></div></div></div></section>